                "text": "On World AIDS Day, we remember those who died of HIV/AIDS and honor those whose lives have been saved as a result of research, medications, advocacy, and vigilance. Testing, prevention, care, and treatment save lives every day. Let us expand our efforts and end this pandemic now!",
