                "text": "On #NBHAAD, let's recognize the disproportionate impact of HIV on Black communities. Structural barriers like lack of access to healthcare and racial bias exacerbate this crisis. We must address these issues to ensure equitable access to prevention and treatment. #EndHIVEpidemic @HRC",
